{"scenario":"flag","description":"fraud_model_v2 flag turned on: fraud-check latency breaks payment (+ an unrelated notify deploy)","mode":"graph","recorded_at":"2026-10-18 05:47","duration":75.41,"agent":{"duration_s":46.9,"tool_calls":9,"cost_usd":0.140048,"input_tokens":104307,"output_tokens":2887,"report":"## Incident report: INC-043 (SEV2), resolved\n\nFrontend is back to normal. I turned the `fraud_model_v2` feature flag off, and the incident was closed in about 0.4 minutes.\n\n**Root cause:** Omar ramped `fraud_model_v2` to 100% 16s before the alert, flipping it from false to true (chg-26c515a8). That pushed fraud-check's p95 latency from about 15ms to about 2.3s. Payment gives up on fraud-check after 1.5s, so payment requests started timing out.\n\n**How it reached users:**\n`frontend` (35% errors) \u2192 `checkout` (failing) \u2192 `payment` (failing, timing out) \u2192 `fraud-check` (p95 2302ms) \u2192 flag `fraud_model_v2`\n\n- **Graph ranking:** fraud-check was the top suspect (score 0.899). It's the deepest unhealthy service on the path, and everything it depends on is healthy. Checkout and payment were only failing because of it.\n- **Logs:** fraud-check v1.9.2 requests normally take 12\u201321ms; the latest ones took 1803\u20132137ms.\n- **Past incident:** INC-027 was the same failure and was fixed the same way, by turning `fraud_model_v2` off.\n- **Runbook RB-FRAUD-01:** says turning the flag off is safe because scoring falls back to the v1 rules engine. It also says not to roll back fraud-check for a flag problem, since the code itself hasn't changed.\n- **Ruled out:** notify v1.2.1 was deployed 17s before the alert, but notify stayed healthy.\n\n**Action taken (1 of 3 allowed):** I set `fraud_model_v2` back to false. I ran it as a dry run first; the plan only affected fraud-check.\n\n**Verification:** Frontend was healthy for two samples in a row: 0% errors and p95 114ms (down from 35% and 1524ms), about 7s after the flag change.\n\n**Who was paged:** @ananya on the risk team (#team-risk), as fraud-check's owner. No webhook is configured, so the page was only recorded in the graph and nobody was actually notified. Someone should tell them directly.\n\n**Follow-up:** This is the second time this has happened (after INC-027). The risk team should fix the v2 model's latency or add a guard to the rollout before turning the flag on again.","start_t":15.09,"end_t":62.89},"events":[{"t":0.05,"kind":"start","text":"healthy baseline"},{"t":3.1,"kind":"inject","text":"fraud_model_v2 flag turned on: fraud-check latency breaks payment (+ an unrelated notify deploy)"},{"t":15.09,"kind":"alert","text":"ALERT frontend error rate 35%, p95 1524ms"},{"t":15.09,"kind":"agent","text":"headless agent started (graph mode)"},{"t":62.89,"kind":"done","text":"agent finished"}],"steps":[{"t":20.45,"n":1,"tool":"rank_suspects","note":"top suspect fraud-check (score 0.899) via path frontend -> checkout -> payment -> fraud-check","targets":["Service:checkout","Service:fraud-check","Service:frontend","Service:notify","Service:payment","Runbook:RB-FRAUD-01","Incident:INC-027","Change:chg-26c515a8"]},{"t":22.05,"n":2,"tool":"get_logs","note":"read 96 log entries of fraud-check","targets":["Service:fraud-check"]},{"t":22.54,"n":3,"tool":"find_similar_incidents","note":"3 similar past incidents, best INC-027","targets":["Incident:INC-019","Incident:INC-027","Incident:INC-031"]},{"t":26.38,"n":4,"tool":"open_incident","note":"INC-043: Frontend errors: fraud-check latency after fraud_model_v2 ramp","targets":["Incident:INC-043"]},{"t":28.92,"n":5,"tool":"set_feature_flag","note":"DRY RUN fraud_model_v2 -> False","targets":["Flag:fraud_model_v2"]},{"t":31.93,"n":6,"tool":"set_feature_flag","note":"SET fraud_model_v2 True -> False","targets":["Flag:fraud_model_v2","Action:act-d88e2506"]},{"t":43.56,"n":7,"tool":"verify_recovery","note":"frontend RECOVERED after 10s","targets":["Service:frontend"]},{"t":47.85,"n":8,"tool":"get_owner","note":"fraud-check is owned by risk (on call: ananya)","targets":["Service:fraud-check","Team:risk","Person:ananya","Runbook:RB-FRAUD-01"]},{"t":47.86,"n":9,"tool":"notify_owner","note":"paged ananya (risk)","targets":["Team:risk","Person:ananya"]},{"t":53.07,"n":10,"tool":"resolve_incident","note":"INC-043 resolved in 0.4 min, root cause fraud-check","targets":["Service:fraud-check","Change:chg-26c515a8","Incident:INC-043"]}],"health":[{"t":0.05,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,41.4],"checkout":["healthy",0.0,98.9],"fraud-check":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"frontend":["healthy",0.0,114.9],"inventory":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"notify":["healthy",0.0,20.4],"payment":["healthy",0.0,42.4]}},{"t":3.1,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,41.4],"checkout":["healthy",0.0,99.3],"fraud-check":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"frontend":["healthy",0.0,113.7],"inventory":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"notify":["healthy",0.0,21.3],"payment":["healthy",0.0,41.6]}},{"t":4.74,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,40.4],"checkout":["healthy",0.0,99.3],"fraud-check":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"frontend":["healthy",0.0,113.7],"inventory":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"notify":["healthy",0.0,16.2],"payment":["healthy",0.0,42.4]}},{"t":7.34,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,42.0],"checkout":["failing",0.156,1555.1],"fraud-check":["degraded",0.0,1654.4],"frontend":["degraded",0.07,1513.3],"inventory":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"notify":["healthy",0.0,16.2],"payment":["failing",0.156,1517.8]}},{"t":9.93,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,40.4],"checkout":["failing",0.562,1561.3],"fraud-check":["degraded",0.0,2243.4],"frontend":["failing",0.25,1522.7],"inventory":["healthy",0.0,21.2],"notify":["healthy",0.0,16.2],"payment":["failing",0.562,1521.4]}},{"t":12.53,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,42.3],"checkout":["failing",0.939,1564.2],"fraud-check":["degraded",0.0,2284.3],"frontend":["failing",0.425,1523.6],"inventory":["healthy",0.0,20.3],"notify":["healthy",0.0,19.2],"payment":["failing",0.969,1523.8]}},{"t":15.14,"s":{"catalog":["healthy",0.0,39.3],"checkout":["failing",1.0,1564.